{"seq":2,"slug":"model-routing-cascading","title":"模型路由与级联","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/model-routing-cascading","wordCount":1883,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"模型路由与级联\">模型路由与级联</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>模型路由根据请求复杂度动态选择最具成本效益的模型，是成本优化的单一最大杠杆（40-70% 节省）。三种模式：静态规则路由（按任务类型确定性分派）、Cascade 级联（从最便宜开始，不达标才升级）、分类器路由（训练轻量模型预判所需级别）。Anthropic 的 Advisor 策略代表了 2026 年的新范式——小模型驱动执行、大模型按需咨询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型路由是单一最大杠杆\">模型路由是单一最大杠杆</h2><p>模型路由——根据请求复杂度动态选择最具成本效益的模型——是 2025-2026 年成本优化实践中公认的单一最大杠杆。原理朴素：70% 以上的生产请求在轻量模型上的表现与旗舰模型无异，但按旗舰价格计费。系统性路由可实现 40-70% 的成本削减。</p>\n<p>RouteNLP（2026，港大）在企业金融客服场景部署 8 周的实测结果：推理成本降低 58%，响应接受率维持 91%，p99 延迟从 1847ms 降至 387ms。AWS 的 IPR（Intelligent Prompt Routing）在 Claude 系列内部路由实现 43.9% 成本降低且保持质量等价。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户请求] --&gt; B{路由决策}&#10;    B --&gt;|简单| C[轻量模型&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5 Nano / Haiku&lt;br/&gt;$0.05-1/M input]&#10;    B --&gt;|中等| D[中端模型&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5-mini / Sonnet&lt;br/&gt;$0.25-3/M input]&#10;    B --&gt;|复杂| E[旗舰模型&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5.2 / Opus&lt;br/&gt;$1.75-5/M input]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F[响应]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;&#10;    G[路由信号] --&gt; B&#10;    G --&gt; G1[输入长度/复杂度]&#10;    G --&gt; G2[任务类型标签]&#10;    G --&gt; G3[历史成功率数据]\">graph TD\n    A[用户请求] --&gt; B{路由决策}\n    B --&gt;|简单| C[轻量模型&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5 Nano / Haiku&lt;br/&gt;$0.05-1/M input]\n    B --&gt;|中等| D[中端模型&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5-mini / Sonnet&lt;br/&gt;$0.25-3/M input]\n    B --&gt;|复杂| E[旗舰模型&lt;br/&gt;GPT-5.2 / Opus&lt;br/&gt;$1.75-5/M input]\n\n    C --&gt; F[响应]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n\n    G[路由信号] --&gt; B\n    G --&gt; G1[输入长度/复杂度]\n    G --&gt; G2[任务类型标签]\n    G --&gt; G3[历史成功率数据]</pre><h2 id=\"三种路由模式\">三种路由模式</h2><h3 id=\"模式一-静态规则路由\">模式一：静态规则路由</h3><p>基于任务类型的确定性路由——简单、可审计、零延迟开销。适合任务边界清晰的系统。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务类型</th>\n<th>路由目标</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>意图分类</td>\n<td>Nano/Haiku</td>\n<td>固定标签集，小模型准确率 &gt;95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体抽取</td>\n<td>Nano/Haiku</td>\n<td>结构化输出，pattern matching 类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情感分析</td>\n<td>Nano/Haiku</td>\n<td>二分类/三分类任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容生成</td>\n<td>Mini/Sonnet</td>\n<td>需要流畅性和创造力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码审查</td>\n<td>Sonnet</td>\n<td>需要理解复杂逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>架构设计</td>\n<td>Opus</td>\n<td>需要多步推理和全局视野</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律/医疗分析</td>\n<td>Opus</td>\n<td>准确率要求极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现极其简单——本质是一个 switch/map：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const MODEL_MAP = {&#10;  classification: &#39;gpt-5-nano&#39;,&#10;  extraction: &#39;gpt-5-nano&#39;,&#10;  sentiment: &#39;gpt-5-nano&#39;,&#10;  summarization: &#39;gpt-5-mini&#39;,&#10;  generation: &#39;gpt-5-mini&#39;,&#10;  code_review: &#39;claude-sonnet-4-6&#39;,&#10;  architecture: &#39;claude-opus-4-6&#39;,&#10;} as const;&#10;&#10;function routeByTaskType(taskType: keyof typeof MODEL_MAP): string {&#10;  return MODEL_MAP[taskType];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MODEL_MAP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  classification: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5-nano'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  extraction: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5-nano'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sentiment: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5-nano'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  summarization: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5-mini'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  generation: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5-mini'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  code_review: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-sonnet-4-6'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  architecture: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-opus-4-6'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> routeByTaskType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">taskType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> typeof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MODEL_MAP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MODEL_MAP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[taskType];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优势：零额外成本、完全确定性、易调试。劣势：粒度粗，同一任务类型内的复杂度差异被忽略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-cascade-级联\">模式二：Cascade 级联</h3><p>从最便宜的模型开始尝试，仅在输出不达标时升级到更贵的模型。兼顾成本最小化和质量保底。</p>\n<p>级联的核心设计决策是<strong>升级判据</strong>——什么条件触发升级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>置信度阈值</strong>：模型输出附带置信度分数，低于阈值则升级</li>\n<li><strong>格式验证</strong>：输出无法通过 schema 验证则升级</li>\n<li><strong>自我验证</strong>：让模型自评回答质量，不满意则升级</li>\n<li><strong>Conformal Prediction</strong>：RouteNLP 使用的分布无关阈值初始化方法</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"MODELS_CASCADE = [&#10;    {&quot;model&quot;: &quot;gpt-5-nano&quot;, &quot;max_cost&quot;: 0.0001},&#10;    {&quot;model&quot;: &quot;gpt-5-mini&quot;, &quot;max_cost&quot;: 0.001},&#10;    {&quot;model&quot;: &quot;gpt-5.2&quot;, &quot;max_cost&quot;: 0.01},&#10;]&#10;&#10;async def cascade_call(prompt: str, quality_threshold: float = 0.8):&#10;    for tier in MODELS_CASCADE:&#10;        response = await call_model(tier[&quot;model&quot;], prompt)&#10;        quality_score = evaluate_response(response)&#10;&#10;        if quality_score &gt;= quality_threshold:&#10;            return response  # 够好就停&#10;&#10;    return response  # 最后一级无论如何返回\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MODELS_CASCADE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5-nano\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5-mini\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gpt-5.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cascade_call</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prompt: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality_threshold: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MODELS_CASCADE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call_model(tier[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        quality_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evaluate_response(response)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_threshold:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 够好就停</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最后一级无论如何返回</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>成本分析</strong>：假设 85% 请求在 Nano 层通过、12% 在 Mini 层通过、3% 升级到旗舰：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>平均成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>0.12</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.03</mn><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{平均成本} = 0.85 \\times C_{nano} + 0.12 \\times (C_{nano} + C_{mini}) + 0.03 \\times (C_{nano} + C_{mini} + C_{flagship})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mini</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nan</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mini</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对比全量旗舰，cascade 的平均成本通常仅为其 15-30%。</p>\n<p><strong>权衡</strong>：cascade 在升级时会产生额外延迟（重新调用更强模型）和额外成本（低级模型的调用费用虽小但非零）。对延迟敏感的场景需要权衡升级率与 p99 延迟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式三-分类器路由\">模式三：分类器路由</h3><p>训练一个轻量分类器预测请求所需的模型级别，一次性路由到正确级别——避免 cascade 的多次调用开销。</p>\n<p>分类器的训练数据来源：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用旗舰模型处理一批请求，记录输出质量</li>\n<li>用低级模型处理相同请求，记录输出质量</li>\n<li>标注&quot;这个请求用低级模型就够了&quot;或&quot;需要高级模型&quot;</li>\n<li>训练轻量 BERT/distilBERT 分类器</li>\n</ol>\n<p>AWS IPR 使用 Qwen3-0.6B 作为路由分类器，在保持 100% 质量等价的前提下，将 59.9% 的请求路由到 Haiku（便宜 12 倍），实现 48.7% 成本节省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"anthropic-advisor-策略\">Anthropic Advisor 策略</h2><p>2026 年 4 月，Anthropic 推出了一种创新的路由模式：<strong>Advisor Strategy</strong>——Opus 作为顾问、Sonnet/Haiku 作为执行者。</p>\n<p>传统模式：大模型编排，小模型执行（top-down）\nAdvisor 模式：小模型驱动，大模型按需咨询（bottom-up）</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"response = client.messages.create(&#10;    model=&quot;claude-sonnet-4-6&quot;,  # executor&#10;    tools=[&#10;        {&#10;            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;advisor_20260301&quot;,&#10;            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;advisor&quot;,&#10;            &quot;model&quot;: &quot;claude-opus-4-6&quot;,&#10;            &quot;max_uses&quot;: 3,  # 成本控制：最多咨询 3 次&#10;        },&#10;    ],&#10;    messages=[...]&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.messages.create(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-sonnet-4-6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># executor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tools</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"advisor_20260301\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"advisor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"claude-opus-4-6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"max_uses\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 成本控制：最多咨询 3 次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    messages</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实测效果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sonnet + Opus advisor：SWE-bench Multilingual 提升 2.7 百分点，同时单任务成本降低 11.9%</li>\n<li>Haiku + Opus advisor：BrowseComp 得分 41.2%（Haiku 单独 19.7%），成本仅为 Sonnet 单独的 15%</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>为什么 Advisor 比传统路由更好</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不需要预判复杂度——执行者自己知道何时需要帮助</li>\n<li>Opus 只生成短计划（400-700 tokens），不执行工具调用——成本可控</li>\n<li>单次 API 请求完成，无需外部编排逻辑</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"路由信号工程\">路由信号工程</h2><p>有效的路由系统需要多维度信号输入：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号类别</th>\n<th>具体指标</th>\n<th>权重参考</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>输入特征</td>\n<td>Token 数、句法复杂度、是否含代码</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务类型</td>\n<td>API endpoint、任务标签、输出格式</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史表现</td>\n<td>同类请求在各模型的成功率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟要求</td>\n<td>是否实时、SLA 等级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户等级</td>\n<td>免费/付费/VIP</td>\n<td>低（业务侧）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"构建路由评估数据集\">构建路由评估数据集</h3><p>在部署路由之前，需要构建评估集来验证路由决策的质量-成本权衡：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样 200-500 个生产请求</li>\n<li>在所有候选模型上运行</li>\n<li>收集质量评分（自动指标 + 人工抽检）</li>\n<li>绘制质量-成本帕累托前沿</li>\n<li>确定各任务类型的&quot;足够好&quot;模型</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"路由系统的常见陷阱\">路由系统的常见陷阱</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：静默质量退化</strong></p>\n<p>路由到低级模型后，输出质量可能在特定 case 上显著下降，但如果没有持续的质量监控，这种退化会被用户投诉而非系统指标发现。</p>\n<p>解决：对路由到低级模型的请求做持续采样评估（如每 100 次抽 1 次用旗舰模型对照）。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：升级率失控</strong></p>\n<p>Cascade 系统如果升级判据过于敏感，可能导致 80% 请求都升级到旗舰——实际成本反而高于全量使用中端模型（因为多了低级模型的&quot;浪费&quot;调用）。</p>\n<p>解决：监控升级率，保持在 15-30% 以下。超过则调整判据或扩大低级模型的能力覆盖。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：路由器本身的代价</strong></p>\n<p>分类器路由为每个请求增加一次轻量模型调用。如果请求量极大（百万级/天），路由器本身的成本也需计入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总成本</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总成本} = C_{router} \\times N + \\sum_{tier} C_{tier} \\times N_{tier}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于 Nano 级模型做路由（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>），百万请求的路由成本约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05/M input），百万请求的路由成本约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">），百万请求的路由成本约</span></span></span></span></span>50/天——通常远小于路由节省的金额，但需要验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实施路线图\">实施路线图</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>行动</th>\n<th>周期</th>\n<th>预期收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Week 1</td>\n<td>接入 token 计量，建立基线</td>\n<td>1 周</td>\n<td>可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Week 2-3</td>\n<td>静态规则路由（按 endpoint 分级）</td>\n<td>2 周</td>\n<td>30-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Week 4-6</td>\n<td>Cascade 级联（加升级判据）</td>\n<td>3 周</td>\n<td>50-60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Week 7+</td>\n<td>分类器路由 + 持续优化</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>60-70%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>模型路由的核心洞察：70% 以上的生产请求不需要旗舰模型，但组织惯性导致全量使用旗舰。三种路由模式适用不同成熟度——静态规则即刻上线、Cascade 在 2-3 周内部署、分类器路由需要更多数据积累。Anthropic 的 Advisor 策略代表了&quot;小模型驱动、大模型按需&quot;的新范式。关键是持续监控路由质量，防止静默退化。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"caching-deduplication\">缓存与去重</a> 在模型路由降低单价后，通过缓存进一步消除重复计算</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模型路由与级联","id":"模型路由与级联"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模型路由是单一最大杠杆","id":"模型路由是单一最大杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"三种路由模式","id":"三种路由模式"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：静态规则路由","id":"模式一-静态规则路由"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：Cascade 级联","id":"模式二-cascade-级联"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：分类器路由","id":"模式三-分类器路由"},{"level":2,"text":"Anthropic Advisor 策略","id":"anthropic-advisor-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"路由信号工程","id":"路由信号工程"},{"level":3,"text":"构建路由评估数据集","id":"构建路由评估数据集"},{"level":2,"text":"路由系统的常见陷阱","id":"路由系统的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"实施路线图","id":"实施路线图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Prompt 压缩与 Token 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/prompt-compression"},"next":{"title":"缓存与去重策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/optimization/caching-deduplication"}}